      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is apparently already a thing, but it's quite annoying to get to as you need to:\n\n1. Click on the 3 dots\n\n2. Click on \"View Instance\"\n\n3. And then finally click on Preload World\n\nDoing so also still leaves the Invite sitting there, so you also need to manually decline it.\n\nI feel like this should really be improved as described in my canny above, cause this is wayyyy more annoying than it needs to be.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-20T19:17:01.297Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now when you get an Invite you can't also Preload the World before joining, which is quite annoying, as invites are often used to get from one place to another.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAdd a \"Preload World\" button to Invite Notifications.  \n\nPressing this button should remove the Invite and start the Preload process, so that you can join once it's done.",
